<title>USA: Hickory Tech to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>Hickory Tech to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>MANKATO, Minn. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hickory Tech Corp said Tuesday that its board of directors authorized a new share repurchase program under which the company may repurchase up to 500,000 shares, or 10.8 percent of its outstanding common stock.</p>
</text>
